_PA2 = [("Pare A", "Pare, kumusta ang Balikatan n’yo sa Palawan?", "Pare, how was your Balikatan in Palawan?"), ("Pare B", "Mabuti naman. Tulad nang dati, nagtayo kami ng paaralan, nagkumpuni ng tulay, nagsagawa ng libreng medikal at dental misyon. E, ikaw, kumusta?", "Fine. Like before, we built a school, repaired a bridge, conducted a free medical and dental mission. And you, how are you?"), ("Pare A", "Eto, madedestino ako sa Subic at Tarlac para sa susunod na Balikatan. Kasado na ’yung schedule.", "Here, I will be assigned to Subic and Tarlac for the next Balikatan. The schedule is already set."), ("Pare B", "Maganda kung ganoon. Siyanga pala, naaalala mo pa ba ’yung mga balon at tangke ng tubig na ginawa natin sa Basilan? Uploaded na sa website.", "That’s good. By the way, do you still remember the wells and water tanks we made in Basilan? It’s uploaded on the website."), ("Pare A", "Katse-check ko lang kagabi. Nakita ko nga. Ang sabi mahigit na limang libong pamilya ang nakikinabang sa proyektong ’yon.", "I just checked it last night. I did see it. It says more than five thousand families are benefitting from that project.")]
